(12138, 3844, 'Beginner - I do not know what SQL is.', 10, 1, TRUE, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start with the basics of SQL. Learn about the syntax and structure of SQL queries. Practice writing simple queries to retrieve data from a database. Familiarize yourself with common SQL functions and operators. As you gain more experience, move on to more complex queries and learn about database design and optimization.', 'Start by learning the basics of SQL syntax and structure. Practice writing simple queries to retrieve data from a database. Familiarize yourself with common SQL functions and operators. As you gain more experience, move on to more complex queries and learn about database design and optimization.', 0),
(12139, 3844, 'Elementary - I have heard of SQL, but never used it.', 20, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of SQL. Familiarize yourself with the syntax and structure of SQL queries. Practice writing simple queries to retrieve data from a database. Learn about common SQL functions and operators. As you gain more experience, move on to more complex queries and learn about database design and optimization.', 'Start by learning the basics of SQL syntax and structure. Practice writing simple queries to retrieve data from a database. Familiarize yourself with common SQL functions and operators. As you gain more experience, move on to more complex queries and learn about database design and optimization.', 0),
(12140, 3844, 'Intermediate - I have a basic understanding of SQL.', 30, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to continue building on your knowledge of SQL. Learn about more advanced SQL functions and operators. Practice writing more complex queries to retrieve and manipulate data from a database. Learn about database design and optimization techniques. Consider pursuing a certification in SQL to demonstrate your expertise.', 'Continue building on your knowledge of SQL. Learn about more advanced SQL functions and operators. Practice writing more complex queries to retrieve and manipulate data from a database. Learn about database design and optimization techniques. Consider pursuing a certification in SQL to demonstrate your expertise.', NULL),
(12141, 3844, 'Proficient - I am comfortable with SQL concepts.', 40, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to continue building on your knowledge of SQL. Learn about advanced SQL functions and operators. Practice writing complex queries to retrieve and manipulate data from a database. Learn about database design and optimization techniques. Consider pursuing a certification in SQL to demonstrate your expertise. Additionally, consider learning about related technologies such as data warehousing and business intelligence.', 'Continue building on your knowledge of SQL. Learn about advanced SQL functions and operators. Practice writing complex queries to retrieve and manipulate data from a database. Learn about database design and optimization techniques. Consider pursuing a certification in SQL to demonstrate your expertise. Additionally, consider learning about related technologies such as data warehousing and business intelligence.', NULL),
(12142, 3844, 'Expert - I can implement SQL strategies.', 50, 5, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to have a deep understanding of SQL and related technologies. Consider pursuing advanced certifications in SQL and related technologies. Practice implementing complex SQL strategies in real-world scenarios. Stay up-to-date with the latest developments in SQL and related technologies.', 'Have a deep understanding of SQL and related technologies. Consider pursuing advanced certifications in SQL and related technologies. Practice implementing complex SQL strategies in real-world scenarios. Stay up-to-date with the latest developments in SQL and related technologies.', 365),
(12143, 3845, 'Beginner - I do not know what a database is.', 10, 1, TRUE, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of databases. You can start by learning about data types, tables, and relationships. You can also learn about SQL and how to write basic queries. With practice and experience, you can become more comfortable with databases and their use cases.', 'To achieve this level, start by learning the basics of databases. Learn about data types, tables, and relationships. Learn about SQL and how to write basic queries. With practice and experience, you can become more comfortable with databases and their use cases.', 0),
(12144, 3845, 'Elementary - I have heard of databases, but I am not sure what they are.', 20, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of databases. You can start by learning about data types, tables, and relationships. You can also learn about SQL and how to write basic queries. With practice and experience, you can become more comfortable with databases and their use cases.', 'To achieve this level, start by learning the basics of databases. Learn about data types, tables, and relationships. Learn about SQL and how to write basic queries. With practice and experience, you can become more comfortable with databases and their use cases.', 0),
(12145, 3845, 'Intermediate - I have a basic understanding of databases.', 30, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to continue learning about databases. You can learn about more advanced topics like indexing, normalization, and stored procedures. You can also practice writing more complex queries and working with larger datasets. With time and experience, you can become more proficient with databases.', 'To achieve this level, continue learning about databases. Learn about more advanced topics like indexing, normalization, and stored procedures. Practice writing more complex queries and working with larger datasets. With time and experience, you can become more proficient with databases.', 0),
(12146, 3845, 'Proficient - I am comfortable with database concepts.', 40, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to continue practicing and gaining experience with databases. You can work on more complex projects and learn about more advanced topics like database design and optimization. You can also explore different database management systems and learn how to work with them. With dedication and hard work, you can become an expert in databases.', 'To achieve this level, continue practicing and gaining experience with databases. Work on more complex projects and learn about more advanced topics like database design and optimization. Explore different database management systems and learn how to work with them. With dedication and hard work, you can become an expert in databases.', 0),
(12147, 3845, 'Expert - I can implement database strategies.', 50, 5, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to have a deep understanding of databases and their use cases. You should be able to design and implement complex database systems and optimize their performance. You should also be able to work with different database management systems and integrate them with other technologies. With years of experience and a passion for databases, you can become a true expert in the field.', 'To achieve this level, have a deep understanding of databases and their use cases. Design and implement complex database systems and optimize their performance. Work with different database management systems and integrate them with other technologies. With years of experience and a passion for databases, you can become a true expert in the field.', 3650),
(12148, 3846, 'Beginner - I do not know what a join is.', 10, 1, TRUE, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start with the basics of SQL and learn about the different types of joins. You can practice by creating sample tables and experimenting with different join types. It is also important to understand the differences between inner, outer, left, and right joins.', 'To achieve this level, start with the basics of SQL and learn about the different types of joins. Practice by creating sample tables and experimenting with different join types.', 0),
(12149, 3846, 'Elementary - I have heard of a join, but I am not sure what it is.', 20, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to learn about the different types of joins and how they work. You can practice by creating sample tables and experimenting with different join types. It is also important to understand the differences between inner, outer, left, and right joins.', 'To achieve this level, learn about the different types of joins and how they work. Practice by creating sample tables and experimenting with different join types.', 0),
(12150, 3846, 'Intermediate - I have a basic understanding of what a join is.', 30, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to continue practicing with different types of joins and understanding how they work. You should also learn about more advanced join concepts, such as self-joins and cross-joins. It is important to understand how to optimize your joins for performance.', 'To achieve this level, continue practicing with different types of joins and understanding how they work. Learn about more advanced join concepts, such as self-joins and cross-joins. Understand how to optimize your joins for performance.', NULL),
(12151, 3846, 'Proficient - I am comfortable with the concepts of joins.', 40, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start working with more complex join scenarios, such as multi-table joins and subqueries. You should also focus on optimizing your joins for performance and understanding how to use indexes effectively.', 'To achieve this level, start working with more complex join scenarios, such as multi-table joins and subqueries. Focus on optimizing your joins for performance and understanding how to use indexes effectively.', NULL),
