(12161, 3848, 'Proficient - I am comfortable with using stored procedures.', 40, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to continue practicing writing stored procedures and using best practices for using them effectively. You should also start learning about advanced topics related to stored procedures, such as error handling and transaction management. With time and practice, you will become an expert in using stored procedures effectively in your work.', 'To achieve this level, you need to continue practicing writing stored procedures and using best practices for using them effectively. You should also start learning about advanced topics related to stored procedures, such as error handling and transaction management. With time and practice, you will become an expert in using stored procedures effectively in your work.', NULL),
