(12297, 3877, 'Expert - Can implement Cybersecurity Awareness strategies. Cybersecurity threats are the malicious attacks that can harm your computer systems, networks, and devices. These threats can be in the form of viruses, malware, phishing, ransomware, and many more. To protect yourself from these threats, you need to learn about cybersecurity awareness and take necessary precautions.', 50, 5, FALSE, NULL, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level of cybersecurity awareness, you need to develop and implement cybersecurity strategies for your organization or business. You should conduct regular risk assessments, develop incident response plans, and train your employees on cybersecurity best practices. You should also stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity regulations and compliance standards to ensure that your organization is protected from legal and financial risks.', 'To achieve this level of cybersecurity awareness, you need to develop and implement cybersecurity strategies for your organization or business. Conduct regular risk assessments, develop incident response plans, and train your employees on cybersecurity best practices. Stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity regulations and compliance standards to ensure that your organization is protected from legal and financial risks.', 30),
(12298, 3878, 'Beginner - Unsure about Cybersecurity Awareness', 10, 1, TRUE, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, one should start by learning the basics of cybersecurity and the potential threats that exist. This can be done through online courses or by attending workshops and seminars. It is also important to stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news and trends. As a beginner, it is recommended to start with simple cybersecurity practices such as using strong passwords and avoiding suspicious emails or links.', 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, start with the basics of cybersecurity and potential threats. Stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news and trends. Use strong passwords and avoid suspicious emails or links.', 0),
(12299, 3878, 'Elementary - Heard of Cybersecurity Awareness', 20, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, one should continue to learn about cybersecurity and the potential threats that exist. This can be done through online courses or by attending workshops and seminars. It is also important to stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news and trends. As an elementary learner, it is recommended to start implementing basic cybersecurity practices such as using strong passwords and avoiding suspicious emails or links.', 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, continue to learn about cybersecurity and potential threats. Stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news and trends. Implement basic cybersecurity practices such as using strong passwords and avoiding suspicious emails or links.', NULL),
(12300, 3878, 'Intermediate - Basic understanding of Cybersecurity Awareness', 30, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, one should have a basic understanding of cybersecurity and the potential threats that exist. This can be done through online courses or by attending workshops and seminars. It is also important to stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news and trends. As an intermediate learner, it is recommended to start implementing more advanced cybersecurity practices such as using two-factor authentication and regularly backing up important data.', 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, have a basic understanding of cybersecurity and potential threats. Stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news and trends. Implement more advanced cybersecurity practices such as using two-factor authentication and regularly backing up important data.', NULL),
(12301, 3878, 'Proficient - Comfortable with Cybersecurity Awareness concepts', 40, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, one should have a good understanding of cybersecurity and the potential threats that exist. This can be done through online courses or by attending workshops and seminars. It is also important to stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news and trends. As a proficient learner, it is recommended to start implementing more advanced cybersecurity practices such as using a virtual private network (VPN) and regularly testing the security of your devices and networks.', 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, have a good understanding of cybersecurity and potential threats. Stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news and trends. Implement more advanced cybersecurity practices such as using a virtual private network (VPN) and regularly testing the security of your devices and networks.', NULL),
(12302, 3878, 'Expert - Can implement Cybersecurity Awareness strategies', 50, 5, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, one should have an expert-level understanding of cybersecurity and the potential threats that exist. This can be done through online courses or by attending workshops and seminars. It is also important to stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news and trends. As an expert, it is recommended to start implementing advanced cybersecurity strategies such as conducting regular security audits and implementing a comprehensive incident response plan.', 'To achieve this level of Cybersecurity Awareness, have an expert-level understanding of cybersecurity and potential threats. Stay up-to-date with the latest cybersecurity news andtrends. Implement advanced cybersecurity strategies such as conducting regular security audits and implementing a comprehensive incident response plan.', NULL),
(12303, 3880, 'Beginner - Unsure about Project Management Essentials', 10, 1, TRUE, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of project management. You can start by reading books or taking online courses. You should also try to get some hands-on experience by working on small projects. As you gain more experience, you can move on to more complex projects and start taking on more responsibility.', 'To achieve this level, you need to learn the basics of project management.', 0),
(12304, 3880, 'Elementary - Heard of Project Management Essentials', 20, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to build on your existing knowledge of project management. You can do this by reading more advanced books or taking more advanced courses. You should also try to get more hands-on experience by working on larger projects. As you gain more experience, you can start taking on more complex projects and start working with more advanced project management tools and techniques.', 'To achieve this level, you need to build on your existing knowledge of project management.', NULL),
(12305, 3880, 'Intermediate - Basic understanding of Project Management Essentials', 30, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start applying your knowledge of project management to real-world projects. You should start taking on more responsibility and working with more advanced project management tools and techniques. You should also start working on larger and more complex projects, and start collaborating with other project managers and team members.', 'To achieve this level, you need to start applying your knowledge of project management to real-world projects.', NULL),
(12306, 3880, 'Proficient - Comfortable with Project Management Essentials concepts', 40, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to continue building on your experience and knowledge of project management. You should start taking on more complex projects and working with more advanced project management tools and techniques. You should also start mentoring other project managers and team members, and start contributing to the development of project management best practices and standards.', 'To achieve this level, you need to continue building on your experience and knowledge of project management.', NULL),
(12307, 3880, 'Expert - Can implement Project Management Essentials strategies', 50, 5, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to have a deep understanding of project management best practices and standards. You should be able to implement these practices and standards in any project, regardless of its size or complexity. You should also be able to mentor other project managers and team members, and contribute to the development of project management best practices and standards at the organizational level.', 'To achieve this level, you need to have a deep understanding of project management best practices and standards.', 365),
(12308, 3882, 'Beginner - Unsure about Project Management Essentials - I have never heard of a Work Breakdown Structure (WBS) before', 10, 1, TRUE, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of project management and familiarizing yourself with the concept of a Work Breakdown Structure (WBS). You can start by reading books or taking online courses on project management. Once you have a basic understanding of project management, you can then move on to learning about the different components of a WBS and how to create one. It may take some time to fully understand the concept, but with practice and dedication, you can become proficient in creating and using a WBS.', 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of project management and familiarizing yourself with the concept of a Work Breakdown Structure (WBS). Once you have a basic understanding of project management, you can then move on to learning about the different components of a WBS and how to create one. It may take some time to fully understand the concept, but with practice and dedication, you can become proficient in creating and using a WBS.', 0),
