(13620, 4331, 'Intermediate - I have a basic understanding of Data Security.', 30, 3, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you should continue to build your knowledge and skills in data security by studying more advanced topics, such as network security, application security, and cloud security. You should also gain practical experience by working on real-world projects and practicing your skills in a safe, controlled environment. With dedication and hard work, you can become proficient in this area.', 'To achieve this level, continue to build your knowledge and skills in data security by studying more advanced topics and gaining practical experience.', 0),
(13621, 4331, 'Proficient - I am comfortable with Data Security concepts.', 40, 4, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you should focus on gaining practical experience by working on real-world projects and practicing your skills in a safe, controlled environment. You should also continue to stay up-to-date with the latest trends and developments in data security by reading industry publications and attending conferences and seminars. With dedication and hard work, you can become an expert in this area.', 'To achieve this level, focus on gaining practical experience and staying up-to-date with the latest trends and developments in data security.', 0),
(13622, 4331, 'Expert - I can implement Data Security strategies.', 50, 5, FALSE, NULL, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you should have a deep understanding of data security concepts and be able to implement a wide range of strategies to protect against threats. You should also be able to analyze and assess risks, develop security policies and procedures, and train others on best practices in data security. With years of experience and a commitment to ongoing learning, you can become a leader in this field.', 'To achieve this level, have a deep understanding of data security concepts and be able to implement a wide range of strategies to protect against threats.', 365),
