(13723, 4350, 'Beginner - I don''t know what Data Governance is', 10, 1, TRUE, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start by understanding the basics of Data Governance. This includes understanding the importance of data quality, data security, and data privacy. You should also familiarize yourself with the various tools and technologies used in Data Governance, such as data catalogs, data lineage tools, and data governance frameworks. Finally, you should work on developing your skills in areas such as data analysis, data modeling, and data management.', 'To achieve this level, you need to start by understanding the basics of Data Governance. This includes understanding the importance of data quality, data security, and data privacy. You should also familiarize yourself with the various tools and technologies used in Data Governance, such as data catalogs, data lineage tools, and data governance frameworks. Finally, you should work on developing your skills in areas such as data analysis, data modeling, and data management.', 0),
