(13733, 4351, 'Beginner - I don''t know what Data Security is', 10, 1, TRUE, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of data security. This includes understanding the different types of threats that can compromise data, as well as the various methods used to protect it. You should also familiarize yourself with the latest industry standards and best practices for data security. This will help you develop a solid foundation of knowledge that you can build on as you progress to higher levels of expertise.', 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of data security.', 0),
(13734, 4351, 'Elementary - I''ve heard of Data Security, but I don''t know much about it', 20, 2, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you should start by building on your existing knowledge of data security. This may involve taking courses or attending workshops to learn more about the latest trends and best practices in the field. You should also seek out opportunities to gain hands-on experience working with data security tools and technologies. This will help you develop a deeper understanding of how data security works in practice, and prepare you for more advanced roles in the field.', 'To achieve this level, you should start by building on your existing knowledge of data security.', 0),
(13735, 4351, 'Intermediate - I have a basic understanding of Data Security', 30, 3, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you should focus on developing your technical skills in data security. This may involve learning how to use specific tools and technologies, or gaining experience working on real-world data security projects. You should also seek out opportunities to collaborate with other professionals in the field, and stay up-to-date with the latest industry trends and best practices. This will help you build a strong foundation of knowledge and skills that you can leverage to advance your career in data security.', 'To achieve this level, you should focus on developing your technical skills in data security.', 0),
(13736, 4351, 'Proficient - I''m comfortable with Data Security concepts', 40, 4, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you should focus on building your leadership and management skills in data security. This may involve taking on more responsibility for managing data security projects, or mentoring junior team members. You should also seek out opportunities to develop your strategic thinking and problem-solving skills, and stay up-to-date with the latest industry trends and best practices. This will help you position yourself as a thought leader in the field, and prepare you for more senior roles in data security.', 'To achieve this level, you should focus on building your leadership and management skills in data security.', 0),
(13737, 4351, 'Expert - I can implement Data Security strategies', 50, 5, FALSE, NULL, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you should focus on developing your expertise in specific areas of data security. This may involve specializing in a particular type of threat or technology, or becoming an expert in a specific industry or sector. You should also seek out opportunities to share your knowledge and expertise with others, such as by speaking at conferences or writing articles for industry publications. This will help you establish yourself as a thought leader in the field, and position yourself for the most senior roles in data security.', 'To achieve this level, you should focus on developing your expertise in specific areas of data security.', 0),
(13738, 4351, 'Beginner - I don''t know what Data Security is', 10, 1, TRUE, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of data security. This includes understanding the different types of threats that can compromise data, as well as the various methods used to protect it. You should also familiarize yourself with the latest industry standards and best practices for data security. This will help you develop a solid foundation of knowledge that you can build on as you progress to higher levels of expertise.', 'To achieve this level, you need to start by learning the basics of data security.', 0),
(13739, 4351, 'Elementary - I''ve heard of Data Security, but I don''t know much about it', 20, 2, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you should start by building on your existing knowledge of data security. This may involve taking courses or attending workshops to learn more about the latest trends and best practices in the field. You should also seek out opportunities to gain hands-on experience working with data security tools and technologies. This will help you develop a deeper understanding of how data security works in practice, and prepare you for more advanced roles in the field.', 'To achieve this level, you should start by building on your existing knowledge of data security.', 0),
(13740, 4351, 'Intermediate - I have a basic understanding of Data Security', 30, 3, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To achieve this level, you should focus on developing your technical skills in data security. This may involve learning how to use specific tools and technologies, or gaining experience working on real-world data security projects. You should also seek out opportunities to collaborate with other professionals in the field, and stay up-to-date with the latest industry trends and best practices. This will help you build a strong foundation of knowledge and skills that you can leverage to advance your career in data security.', 'To achieve this level, you should focus on developing your technical skills in data security.', 0),
